h of the benthic reaver's tail to within the reach of the benthic reaver's tail</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The benthic reaver makes a tail Strike against the triggering creature and can use Improved Knockdown if the attack hits, even if it isn't the benthic reaver's turn. If the benthic reaver knocks the target @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}, it disrupts the triggering move action.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.Xe2GOMh7IIFQD8Uu"},{"_id":"KVg8aQDdtGbbwMY8","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":1100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.KVg8aQDdtGbbwMY8"},{"_id":"vvjOTuOMXpAw3Ixd","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Numbing Ice","sort":1200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A creature who takes damage from the benthic reaver's eye beam Strike must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:41] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} as cold stiffens its limbs. A flying creature who fails its save also descends safely to the ground below. This is forced movement.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["cold"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.vvjOTuOMXpAw3Ixd"},{"_id":"JRVNlfIPlDWOJtj4","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp","name":"Song of the Lost","sort":1300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The benthic reaver unleashes a cry of mourning. All creatures within 60 feet must attempt a @Check[will|dc:41] save to resist. The benthic reaver can't use Song of the Lost for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Song of the Lost]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.dfCMdR4wnpbYNTix]{Stunned 1} with sympathy.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","auditory","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.JRVNlfIPlDWOJtj4"},{"_id":"DVThmJrdhHWi62Yw","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Tail Sweep","sort":1400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The benthic reaver makes a tail Strike against each enemy within its reach. These attacks count toward the benthic reaver's multiple attack penalty, but the multiple attack penalty doesn't increase until after the benthic reaver makes all its attacks.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.DVThmJrdhHWi62Yw"},{"_id":"q0VsEUr8eeQrnQcV","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.LbnsT8yXchHMQT3t"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/FreeAction.webp","name":"Improved Knockdown","sort":1500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ImprovedKnockdown]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"improved-knockdown","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!q7xr4R7zQ3iYRkV3.q0VsEUr8eeQrnQcV"}],"name":"Benthic Reaver","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":6},"con":{"mod":7},"dex":{"mod":8},"int":{"mod":6},"str":{"mod":10},"wis":{"mod":8}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"all-around vision","value":46},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":500,"temp":0,"value":500},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"cold"},{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"void"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"precision"},{"t